@startuml lld-us5-sequence
title LLD-US5 See all accounts and balances: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant AccountController
participant AccountService
participant CbsAdapter
Browser -> AccountController : GET /accounts
AccountController -> AccountService : accounts(cust)
AccountService -> CbsAdapter : accounts(cust)
CbsAdapter --> AccountService : 3 accounts
AccountController --> Browser : JSON list
@enduml